    "A management key can control your whole OpenRouter account, including creating and deleting other API keys. AgentMeter only reads usage and balance — it cannot spend credits or change anything. A regular API key is safer; use Connect to get a dedicated key for AgentMeter that you can revoke anytime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A management key can control your whole OpenRouter account, including creating and deleting other API keys. AgentMeter only reads usage and balance — it cannot spend credits or change anything. A regular API key is safer; use Connect to get a dedicated key for AgentMeter that you can revoke anytime."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una clave de administración puede controlar toda tu cuenta de OpenRouter, incluida la creación y eliminación de otras claves API. AgentMeter solo lee el uso y el saldo; no puede gastar créditos ni cambiar nada. Una clave API normal es más segura; usa Conectar para obtener una clave dedicada para AgentMeter que puedas revocar en cualquier momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
