    "An Admin key can see billing details and manage other keys. AgentMeter only reads your balance; it cannot spend credits or change settings. An Inference key is safer and also works with AgentMeter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An Admin key can see billing details and manage other keys. AgentMeter only reads your balance; it cannot spend credits or change settings. An Inference key is safer and also works with AgentMeter."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una clave de administrador puede ver detalles de facturación y administrar otras claves. AgentMeter solo lee tu saldo; no puede gastar créditos ni cambiar la configuración. Una clave de inferencia es más segura y también funciona con AgentMeter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Admin key shows richer billing detail but is more powerful — only switch if you need that extra detail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An Admin key shows richer billing detail but is more powerful — only switch if you need that extra detail."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una clave de administrador muestra más detalle de facturación, pero es más poderosa — cámbiala solo si necesitas ese detalle extra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Inference key is the safer default — it lets apps run models but limits access to billing and key management. AgentMeter only reads your balance through a read-only endpoint; it cannot spend credits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An Inference key is the safer default — it lets apps run models but limits access to billing and key management. AgentMeter only reads your balance through a read-only endpoint; it cannot spend credits."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una clave de inferencia es la opción más segura por defecto: permite que las apps ejecuten modelos, pero limita el acceso a facturación y administración de claves. AgentMeter solo lee tu saldo mediante un punto de acceso de solo lectura; no puede gastar créditos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
