    "This API key lets apps use your OpenRouter credits up to a spending limit you set. AgentMeter only reads how much has been used; it cannot spend money or change your account. If you used Connect, OpenRouter created a dedicated key just for AgentMeter that you can revoke anytime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This API key lets apps use your OpenRouter credits up to a spending limit you set. AgentMeter only reads how much has been used; it cannot spend money or change your account. If you used Connect, OpenRouter created a dedicated key just for AgentMeter that you can revoke anytime."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta clave API permite que las apps usen tus créditos de OpenRouter hasta un límite de gasto que tú defines. AgentMeter solo lee cuánto se ha usado; no puede gastar dinero ni cambiar tu cuenta. Si usaste Conectar, OpenRouter creó una clave dedicada solo para AgentMeter que puedes revocar en cualquier momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This API key lets apps use your OpenRouter credits. AgentMeter only reads usage; it cannot spend money or change your account. If you used Connect, OpenRouter created a dedicated key just for AgentMeter that you can revoke anytime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This API key lets apps use your OpenRouter credits. AgentMeter only reads usage; it cannot spend money or change your account. If you used Connect, OpenRouter created a dedicated key just for AgentMeter that you can revoke anytime."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta clave API permite que las apps usen tus créditos de OpenRouter. AgentMeter solo lee el uso; no puede gastar dinero ni cambiar tu cuenta. Si usaste Conectar, OpenRouter creó una clave dedicada solo para AgentMeter que puedes revocar en cualquier momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key is tied to a GLM Coding Plan subscription. AgentMeter reads your time and token quotas (they reset every few hours). It cannot spend money, call models, or change your account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This key is tied to a GLM Coding Plan subscription. AgentMeter reads your time and token quotas (they reset every few hours). It cannot spend money, call models, or change your account."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta clave está vinculada a una suscripción GLM Coding Plan. AgentMeter lee tus cuotas de tiempo y de tokens (se restablecen cada pocas horas). No puede gastar dinero, llamar modelos ni cambiar tu cuenta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key lets apps call DeepSeek models using your prepaid balance. AgentMeter only reads how much balance is left; it cannot spend money or change your account.": {
